      "content": "We had 𝗦𝗢 𝗠𝗨𝗖𝗛 𝗙𝗨𝗡 on Tuesday evening that we're doing it again!\n\nThe amazing Adam Jones, founder of Cinderella Events, hosted an online Murder Mystery for 65 of our HoLT members.\n\nWe arrived without knowing what to expect. \nBut when we started pouring over the evidence with our teams, we were all immersed in catching the killer.\n\nMembers in the community have been raving about how much fun it was. \nThat they weren't sure if it would be their kind of event, but they loved it. \n\nThe level of detail was incredible, with actors playing suspects, warrants to submit for access, cyphers to solve to gain more evidence, we interrogated suspects in full costumes with realistic backdrops. \n\nI've never known anything like it! \n\nAnd we enjoyed it so much, members have demanded we do it again. \n\nBut this time... we're having a custom one just for us, at the sad expense of Backdoor Barry 😲\n\nThe only way to get involved is to join the community. \n\nOr, if you're a lover of murder mysteries, get in touch with Adam to host your own - online, or in-person, for corporate events, murder mystery weekends... he does it all, and he can build them entirely customised for your business, brand, or wild idea. \n\nWanna find out who killed Barry?\n\nYou'll have to join us inside The HoLT, while he's still alive to let you in....\n\nDoors open again very soon www.the-HoLT.com",
